    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f A Dark RPG Journey Through the Mist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mist</strong> is a gripping <strong>RPG adventure</strong> that blends story-driven exploration, character evolution, and chilling horror elements \u2014 all wrapped in an atmospheric idle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64 Start your path as a fragile human in a world overrun by alien horrors. Evolve, adapt, and become something far greater \u2014 or far more terrifying \u2014 in your quest to <strong>save your missing daughter</strong> and uncover the secrets hidden within the Mist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f RPG Progression with a Monstrous Twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience, unlock new abilities, and transform your appearance as you grow stronger. <strong>Your evolution changes everything</strong> \u2014 your powers, your look, even your morality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to survivors of the invasion \u2014 the Missourians. Friend or foe? <strong>Your choices shape the story</strong>. Decide who you trust, what you become, and how far you\u2019re willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddec Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong> hordes of alien enemies and face off against deadly bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVE</strong> your hero as you gain strength, transforming into a terrifying force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK</strong> unique superpowers, search for resources, and uncover ancient totems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE</strong> dialogue options that affect the story and relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> 8 eerie, story-rich locations inspired by 90s America.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSE</strong> yourself in a haunting horror RPG atmosphere with stunning visuals and sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Idle Mechanics. Active Decisions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a <strong>relaxing idle core</strong> that lets you grow even while you're away \u2014 but don't let your guard down. The world of Mist is dangerous, and every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf11 Will You Remain Human\u2026 or Embrace the Monster Within?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a dark RPG experience like no other. <strong>Download Mist now</strong> and step into the battle between light and darkness \u2014 your destiny awaits.</p>",
