ph\" ><strong>IMMERSE</strong> yourself in a haunting horror RPG atmosphere with stunning visuals and sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Idle Mechanics. Active Decisions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a <strong>relaxing idle core</strong> that lets you grow even while you're away \u2014 but don't let your guard down. The world of Mist is dangerous, and every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf11 Will You Remain Human\u2026 or Embrace the Monster Within?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a dark RPG experience like no other. <strong>Download Mist now</strong> and step into the battle between light and darkness \u2014 your destiny awaits.</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83e\uddec Uncover the secrets of a ruined world in Mist \u2014 a dark RPG with idle mechanics, evolution, and horror vibes. \u2694\ufe0f Battle alien horrors, shape your destiny, and search for your missing daughter in a story where every choice matters.",
